    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "/before-after-preview — show the reviewer the change, not a description of it",
      "prov:value": "It covers every content type\nthis platform renders.\n\nOwner, 2026-09-30: *\"make sure before after previews are well documented skill\nthat genealizes (e.g. fhir, documenation, papers, websites) as parr of. review\nand feedback processes\"*.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "How this sits beside its neighbours",
      "prov:value": "**A staging \"after\" is not permanent.** `gh-pages` keeps at most ten\n`branches/<slug>/` previews and rotates the least recently updated off (owner\nruling 2026-10-02, issue #1868), so a link in a preview can 404 days later\nwhile the PR is still open.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1868",
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The rule",
      "prov:value": "Name the change so the reviewer looks for it, then\nlet the pair confirm it (owner, 2026-10-01: *\"provide/show before/after,\nprovide narrative description of change\"*).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-01"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "2. Stable capture — load everything, then check the two shots line up",
      "prov:value": "**The failure this section is written from.** The first capture of the Folio\ntab fix (#1693) was invalid. Lazy images loaded between the before and after\nshots, so the text moved and the two pictures showed *different content* at\nthe same scroll offset. They looked plausible, and a reviewer would have been\ncomparing text positions rather than the fix. The reference-element check\ncatches this. Looking at the pictures does not.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1693"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "pr",
      "cat-harness:section": "3. Measure, don't just show",
      "prov:value": "Folio tab, `platform.html`, 19 scroll positions at 1280×900:\n*text visible beside the handle at **16 of 19** positions before, **0 of 19**\nafter*. At 390×844: **18 of 20** before, **0 of 20** after. PR #1709's own\ntable used 97 px steps across four page and viewport pairs:\nplatform 1280 9/21 → 0, platform 390 32/39 → 0, index 1280 25/50 → 0,\ncat-harness/index 390 36/60 → 0.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "PR #1709"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "5. Honest status — one line, at the top",
      "prov:value": "A preview that looks complete but hides an unchecked axis is a false green\n(`dh4f`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean dh4f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "6. Publishing — a private page, updated in place",
      "prov:value": "A preview\n  without alt text cannot be used by a reviewer with a screen reader, and the\n  owner is one of this platform's reviewers with access needs."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/before-after-preview.md#provenance-9",
